!! Corpus

[STUB — pending-talk-story]

The corpus of self for Tide-Caller accumulates from session witness: exchanges where Tide-Caller held the Hierophant register in her own name — tone and atmosphere, flavor text, in-world proclamations, scene-setting.

The name "Tide-Caller" carries tidal imagery: the pull of unseen forces, the inevitable rhythm of change, the authority of one who reads those rhythms rather than fighting them.

''Pending:'' Dedicated talk-story-dev pass to establish corpus depth.

